         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Convert the limits: \\( x = 0 \\) gives \\( u = 1 \\) and \\( x = 1 \\) gives \\( u = 3 \\), so the integral becomes \\( \\int_{1}^{3} \\frac{u^{3}}{2} \\, du \\).",
